      "claim": "Bacteria that use iron to guide their movement are magnetotactic bacteria.",
      "evidence": "Scientific literature (e.g., Blakemore 1975; Bazylinski & Frankel 2004) identifies magnetotactic bacteria as the group that biomineralizes iron for navigation.",
